@tinder-maxwellelliott We only have a handful of objc_library targets, so we just skip using header maps for now to work around this. If you just want to support building for the simulator on Apple Silicon, you can try to patch Bazel 4.2.1 with the necessary changes:

* Enable Apple Silicon iOS simulator support via use of new CPU type. https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/commit/c1ea2d4b9cb6afa33eabba285f7c962c2f954e23
* Add ios_sim_arm64 crosstool support https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/commit/101e526116df778a087a60ace0cad4a0f894bdf4 (or use a custom crosstool)
